        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, asphalt shingle roofs typically cost around $4.50 to $12.00 per square foot installed (roughly $9,000 to $17,000+ for an average home), while metal roofs generally run $5.00 to $20.00+ per square foot installed (roughly $19,000 to $36,000+ for a typical home) depending on the roof style and scope of work.",
